headers {
  x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Factorial API (sandbox)

  Collection-level config. All requests inherit the `x-api-key` header from
  here, resolved from the `apiKey` variable defined in the selected
  environment (see `environments/`).

  ## Setup

  1. Open this folder as a collection in Bruno.
  2. Select the **Sandbox** environment (top-right).
  3. The `apiKey` value lives in `environments/Sandbox.bru`, which is
     gitignored. Copy `environments/Sandbox.bru.example` to
     `environments/Sandbox.bru` and paste your key.

  ## Conventions (validated against the live sandbox)

  - Auth header: `x-api-key: <raw key>` (no prefix).
  - Dated API path: `/api/2026-04-01/resources/<group>/<resource>`.
  - Base URLs: sandbox `https://api.eu2.demo.factorial.dev`,
    production `https://api.factorialhr.com`.
}
